      "format": "shorts",
      "language": "en",
      "title": "손이 크다 ≠ big hands! Guess 3 Korean idioms in 3 seconds 🧶 #learnkorean",
      "text": "Can you guess these 3 Korean idioms in 3 seconds? 🧶\n\n손이 크다 — not “big hands”: generous (cooks way too much!)\n발이 넓다 — not “wide feet”: knows lots of people\n눈이 높다 — not “high eyes”: has high standards\n\nSay it: 손이 커요 · 발이 넓어요 · 눈이 높아요\n\nHow many did you get? Comment your score 0/3 – 3/3 👇\nGood luck on TOPIK 108! 화이팅!\n\nSYNK LAB · Korean idiom quiz with Mongle.\n#learnkorean #koreanlanguage #studykorean #TOPIK",
      "alt": [
        "Felt mascot Mongle hosts a Korean idiom quiz. Felt hands, feet and eyes show the literal readings of 손이 크다, 발이 넓다 and 눈이 높다, then a table piled with dumplings, a network of felt friends and an eye on a tall pedestal show the real meanings."
      ],
